    "reviews": "\u201cI was shook... and I stayed shook till the credits rolled.  And then I was shook some more.  It kept getting weirder and weirder.  Moving Houses is a legitimately great indie horror game.\u201d<br>Dead Scene Media<br><br>\u201cMoving Houses is the coziest nightmare we\u2019ve ever played.\u201d<br>Fearzine<br><br>\u201cThe game excels in creating an eerie atmosphere, especially with its visual design. The realistic items and charming environments lull you into a false sense of security, only for the house to slowly reveal its true, horrifying nature.\u201d<br>Screen Hype<br>",
